```cshtml
@{
    Layout = null;
}

<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Add Employee</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="~/css/site.css" />
</head>
<body>

    <div class="add-page">

        <div class="add-card">

            <div class="add-header">
                <div class="add-icon">+</div>
                <h1>Add New Employee</h1>
                <p>Create a new employee record</p>
            </div>

            <form action="/Home/AddEmployee" method="get">

                <div class="field">
                    <label for="Name">Employee Name</label>
                    <input id="Name" type="text" name="Name" placeholder="Enter employee name" required />
                </div>

                <div class="form-row">

                    <div class="field">
                        <label for="Age">Age</label>
                        <input id="Age" type="number" name="Age" placeholder="Enter age" required />
                    </div>

                    <div class="field">
                        <label for="Salary">Salary</label>
                        <input id="Salary" type="number" name="Salary" placeholder="Enter salary" required />
                    </div>

                </div>

                <div class="field">
                    <label for="DepartmentId">Department ID</label>
                    <input id="DepartmentId" type="number" name="DepartmentId" placeholder="Enter department ID" required />
                </div>

                <div class="form-actions">

                    <a href="/Home/Index" class="cancel-btn">
                        Cancel
                    </a>

                    <button type="submit" class="save-btn">
                        Add Employee
                    </button>

                </div>

            </form>

        </div>

    </div>

</body>
</html>
```

كده لما تدوس **Add Employee** هيستدعي:

```csharp
AddEmployee(Employee emp)
```

وبالتالي يعمل:

```csharp
db.Employees.Add(emp);
db.SaveChanges();
```

ويضيف الموظف فعليًا.
